{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17212190","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17212190","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1721219001:1":{"text":"자, 잠깐만요! 제가 졌습니다. 다시는 백작을 찾지 않겠습니다...","source_cn":"别、别打了！我认输，我不进去找拉米尔就是了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4446C889E718B75B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:2:1721219001":{"text":"자, 잠깐만요! 제가 졌습니다. 다시는 백작을 찾지 않겠습니다...","source_cn":"别、别打了！我认输，我不进去找拉米尔就是了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4446C889E718B75B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1721219002:1":{"text":"잘못했습니다. 순간적으로 이성을 잃어서... 라밀 백작과는 약간의 개인적인 갈등이 있었을 뿐이라, 저희끼리 해결하면 됩니다!","source_cn":"我、我错了，都是我一时昏了头。我只是……只是和拉米尔伯...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC1AC0DF48A829305","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:4:1721219002":{"text":"잘못했습니다. 순간적으로 이성을 잃어서... 라밀 백작과는 약간의 개인적인 갈등이 있었을 뿐이라, 저희끼리 해결하면 됩니다!","source_cn":"我、我错了，都是我一时昏了头。我只是……只是和拉米尔伯爵有一点小小的矛盾，我们私下里解决就好！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC1AC0DF48A829305","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1721219003:1":{"text":"그건...","source_cn":"这……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7BC93F535E7087F1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1721219004:1":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1721219005:1":{"text":"방금 행동은 주거 침입 미수에 해당하는 범죄입니다.","source_cn":"你要清楚，你刚刚的行为属于入室未遂，是犯法的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9531F33BB6B934E1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1721219006:1":{"text":"근위대는 법에 따라 지금 즉시 체포하고 주둔지로 압송해 심문하고 처벌할 권한이 있습니다.","source_cn":"依照律法，我完全有权将你就地逮捕，带回守备军驻地审讯判刑。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x754C8CEA64BAE28F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1721219007:1":{"text":"자, 잘못했습니다! 억울해요. 잘못은 제가 한 게 아닙니다!","source_cn":"不、不要抓我！我、我是无辜的，错的又不是我！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC26DF6AC14567EEE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1721219008:1":{"text":"말만으로는 증거가 될 수 없습니다. 전후 사정을 알지 못하는데, 무슨 근거로 그 말을 믿어야 합니까?","source_cn":"口说无凭，我们不了解你行为的前因后果，凭什么相信你是无辜的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0D0B83166712BC84","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1721219009:1":{"text":"라밀 백작을 찾아온 합리적인 이유가 있다면 말씀하십시오.","source_cn":"除非，你能给出一个合理的解释，说说你来找拉米尔伯爵的原因。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD628EE98134EFDF7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1721219010:1":{"text":"정말 참작할 만한 사정이 있다면, 처벌을 감경하는 것도 고려할 것입니다.","source_cn":"倘若真是情有可原，我可以考虑酌情减少对你的处罚。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4F8CA809E41D5917","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1721219011:1":{"text":"...저, 정말입니까?","source_cn":"……你、你保证？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE91657DB36B83745","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1721219012:1":{"text":"단, 진실을 말해야 할 겁니다.","source_cn":"前提是，你要诚实。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x91D08BDD645190AD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1721219013:1":{"text":"그, 그렇게 말씀하신다면...","source_cn":"好吧，既然你这么说……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x52D5CE152179BEAD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1721219014:1":{"text":"장사를 해서 돈을 좀 벌었거든요. 그래서 작위 하나를 사서 귀족이 되고 싶었습니다.","sour